<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Acreage Simulator | Shared Harvest &amp; Team Hub</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg: #0f172a; --card: #1e293b; --txt: #f8fafc; --primary: #27ae60; --primary-dark: #1e8449;
            --hud: #144d29; --accent: #38bdf8; --muted: #94a3b8; --border: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
        }
        body { font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; background: var(--bg); color: var(--txt); margin: 0; padding: 20px; line-height: 1.6; }
        .container { max-width: 900px; margin: 40px auto; background: var(--card); border-radius: 14px; padding: 35px; border: 1px solid var(--border); box-shadow: 0 12px 32px rgba(0,0,0,0.5); }
        h1 { color: #4ade80; font-size: 1.8rem; margin-top: 0; border-bottom: 2px solid var(--border); padding-bottom: 15px; }
        h2 { color: var(--accent); font-size: 1.2rem; margin-top: 25px; }
        p, label { color: var(--muted); } strong { color: var(--txt); }
        .panel { background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.6); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 10px; padding: 25px; margin-top: 20px; }
        .btn { background: var(--primary); color: #fff; padding: 12px 24px; border: none; border-radius: 8px; font-weight: bold; cursor: pointer; transition: background 0.2s; text-decoration: none; display: inline-block; }
        .btn:hover { background: var(--primary-dark); }
        .stat-box { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; background: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.05); border: 1px solid rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.2); padding: 15px 20px; border-radius: 8px; margin-bottom: 15px; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="container">
    <h1>Shared Harvest Systems &amp; Team Hub (Year 5 Review)</h1>
    <p>You have successfully completed your first 5-year production cycle. Before advancing into mature enterprise expansion (Years 6–10), review your cooperative systems and invest your team education points to optimize risk reduction.</p>

    <div class="panel">
        <h2>Active Enterprise Profile</h2>
        <div class="stat-box">
            <span>Shared Harvest MOU Status:</span>
            <strong id="mou-status" style="color:#4ade80;">Active</strong>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-box">
            <span>Cooperative Infrastructure &amp; Distribution:</span>
            <strong style="color:var(--accent);">Integrated (3 Cooperative Acres)</strong>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-box">
            <span>Available Team Education &amp; Advisory Points:</span>
            <strong id="team-points-display" style="color:#f59e0b;">3 Points</strong>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="panel">
        <h2>Invest Team Points in Enterprise Resilience</h2>
        <p>Allocate your education points to prepare your farm infrastructure for the upcoming multi-year scale:</p>
        
        <label style="display: block; margin-bottom: 12px; cursor: pointer;">
            <input type="checkbox" id="invest-labor" checked style="margin-right: 8px;"> 
            <strong>Cooperative Labor Share &amp; Training (-10% Overhead Costs in Years 6–10)</strong>
        </label>
        <label style="display: block; cursor: pointer;">
            <input type="checkbox" id="invest-soil" checked style="margin-right: 8px;"> 
            <strong>Soil Health &amp; Regenerative SOPs (+15% Crop Resilience against weather shocks)</strong>
        </label>
    </div>

    <div style="margin-top: 30px; text-align: right;">
        <button class="btn" onclick="proceedToAdvancedEnterprise()">Proceed to Years 6–10 Expansion →</button>
    </div>
</div>

<script>
    let gameState = JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem('farmGameState')) || {
        mouActive: true, teamPoints: 3, cash: 15000, year: 5
    };

    document.getElementById('mou-status').innerText = gameState.mouActive ? "Active (Subsidized & Supported)" : "Independent (No Cooperative Mandate)";
    document.getElementById('team-points-display').innerText = `${gameState.teamPoints || 3} Points`;

    function proceedToAdvancedEnterprise() {
        gameState.laborBuffActive = document.getElementById('invest-labor').checked;
        gameState.soilBuffActive = document.getElementById('invest-soil').checked;
        gameState.year = 6;
        localStorage.setItem('farmGameState', JSON.stringify(gameState));
        window.location.href = 'years6-10.html';
    }
</script>
</body>
</html>
